# Sphinx of the Guildpact: "Sphinx of the Guildpact is all colors" works in every zone (CR 604.3; the ruling), so cast
# it is a multicolored spell, and General Ferrous Rokiric makes a Golem for it. On the battlefield its hexproof from
# monocolored (CR 702.11d) keeps Bot2's Lightning Bolt (red alone) from targeting it, while Bot2's Lightning Helix (red
# and white) may, and deals it 3.

